+    """The one place that decides what mode a file made by a test has: no group and no other-user bits (umask 077).
+    The desk refuses a key or password file that other users can read, so every test that writes a made-up key gets a
+    file that passes, with no chmod of its own. A test that needs a readable file says so with an explicit chmod.
